<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ku" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ڕۆژی لەدایکبوونت پیرۆزبێت 💐</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe6f2,#e9ddff,#dff7ff);overflow:hidden;color:#5b315d}
.card{width:min(92%,560px);padding:45px 28px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.8);border-radius:32px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(90,40,90,.18);position:relative;z-index:2}
h1{font-size:clamp(34px,8vw,58px);margin:8px 0 20px;color:#b44b86}
.message{font-size:clamp(22px,5vw,32px);line-height:1.8;font-weight:bold}
.sub{font-size:18px;opacity:.75;margin-top:18px}.cake{font-size:72px;animation:bounce 1.8s infinite}.flowers{font-size:38px;margin:18px}
.balloon{position:absolute;font-size:44px;animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite}.b1{left:7%;top:15%}.b2{right:8%;top:20%;animation-delay:1s}.b3{left:15%;bottom:12%;animation-delay:2s}.b4{right:14%;bottom:10%;animation-delay:3s}
@keyframes bounce{50%{transform:translateY(-9px)}}@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-25px) rotate(5deg)}}
.confetti{position:fixed;top:-20px;width:9px;height:15px;animation:fall linear forwards;z-index:1}
@keyframes fall{to{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg);opacity:.2}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="balloon b1">🎈</div><div class="balloon b2">🎈</div><div class="balloon b3">🎈</div><div class="balloon b4">🎈</div>
<main class="card">
<div class="cake">🎂</div>
<div class="flowers">💐 🤍 💐</div>
<h1>ڕۆژی لەدایکبوونت پیرۆزبێت!</h1>
<div class="message">تەمەن درێژبی 💐🤍</div>
<div class="sub">هیوادارم ساڵێکی پڕ لە خۆشی و سەرکەوتن بێت ✨</div>
</main>
<script>
for(let i=0;i<55;i++){let e=document.createElement('i');e.className='confetti';e.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';e.style.animationDuration=(3+Math.random()*5)+'s';e.style.animationDelay=Math.random()*4+'s';e.style.transform='rotate('+Math.random()*360+'deg)';document.body.appendChild(e)}
</script>
</body></html>
